# Line endings are LF in this repository, for every text file.
#
# This was not always so. Files added in recent editions were LF while files
# untouched since the first import were CRLF, so editing one line of an old file
# rewrote the whole file's endings and the diff for that edition said nothing.
# Worse, the reader package delivered for review and the tree published here
# could differ byte for byte while containing the same text, which defeats the
# checksum manifest they are both supposed to be checked against.
#
# Everything is LF, and this file keeps it that way. Git still checks out CRLF
# on Windows where a tool needs it; it is the stored form that is pinned.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz  binary
